KARBALA KA LENE INTEQAM KIJIYE ZAHOOR YA IMAAM<br>
<br>
Zalimoun Ke Qabze Me Hai Aj Siriya<br>
Qabre Binte Murtuza Ko Qaid Kardiya<br>
Hogaya Udaas Sher-e-Shaam<br>
<br>
Gham Me Shahe Ke Dil Hamare Doobe Jate Hai<br>
Majliso Mei Aap Humko Yaad Aate Hai<br>
Muntazir Hai Aap Ke Ghulam<br>
<br>
Qabr Mei Nahi Hai Ab Bhi fatima Ko Chain<br>
Zalimoun Ko Khall Raha Hai Matam-e-Hussain<br>
Aake Kijiye Zulm Ko Tamam<br>
<br>
Bekasoun Ke Karbala Ke Bhooke Pyasoun Ka<br>
Binte Murtuza Ke Dono Shahzadoun Ka<br>
Badla Aake Lijiye Imaam<br>
<br>
Thokare Qadam Qadam Pe Khate Hai Hussain<br>
Noujawan Ki Lash Youn Uthate Hai Hussain<br>
Tha Laboun Pe Bawafa Ka Naam<br>
<br>
Pherdi Gale Pe Shahe Ke Shimr Ne churi<br>
Ediya Ragadna Shahe Ka Waqt-e-Aaqri<br>
Bhool Hum Na Payenge Imaam<br>
<br>
Faqr-e-Mustafa Aye Faqr-e-Yousuf-e-Hazeen<br>
Baarwe Imaam Aye Ali ke Jaanasheen<br>
Aap Per durood Aur Salam<br>
<br>
Ho-Chuke Hai Ahle Baith Haye Darbadar<br>
Dekhkar Nazare Ko Ye Nouke Naize Per<br>
Khoon Rote Hai Shah-e-Anaam<br>
<br>
Waris-e-Hussain Aab Zahoor Keejiye<br>
Aake Mushkiloun Ko Dour Keejiye<br>
Hyder Aap Ke Hai Ghulam